      "content": "i know there are numbers i can call but they dont pay the bills or fix the fact that i've lost everything. it's just... it's so quiet and heavy. like there's no way to actually fix this, it's just a debt that keeps growing and a life that's already ruined. it feels like i'm just waiting for the bottom to fall out completely.",
